  m_text: 'Controls:


    WASD - move player


    Tab - change camera perspective


    Arrow
    Keys - move camera


    - / +(=) - to zoom in and out on the level camera


    Right
    Shift - reset level camera to closest wall


    Space - switch gravity


    E
    - mine blocks


    F - AI Buddy / Talk to NPC


    P - pause menu


    L -
    restart level'
